Package: cf-ddns
Version: 0.1.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), ca-certificates, systemd (>= 252), adduser
Maintainer: CF-DDNS Maintainers <cf-ddns@localhost>
Description: Cloudflare dynamic DNS command-line client for Raspberry Pi
 Chinese interactive setup, direct public IPv4 detection, DNS-only A record
 synchronization and optional systemd timer. Uses only the Python standard
 library. No credentials are included and automatic updates start only
 after interactive configuration.
